SETUP:
    pins for the LED matrix (DIN, CLK, CS)
    light sensor pin, threshold = 400 (how bright counts as "bright")
    left button, right button, reset button (pulled up, they read LOW when pressed)
    indicator LEDs: leftA, leftB, rightA, rightB
    servo on servoPin, starts centered at 90°
    sweeping = false, direction = 0
    sweep range: 0 to 180

    icons ready to draw in the matrix: a centered dot (idle mode), a left arrow, a right arrow

FUNCTION isPressed(pin):
    IF pin is LOW:
        wait 50ms so we're not fooled by noise
        IF it's still LOW:
            yep, that's a press
    otherwise, nothing happened

FUNCTION drawPattern(pattern):
    push each of the 8 rows onto the matrix

FUNCTION goToCenter():
    stop sweeping, direction back to 0
    servo back to 90°
    all LEDs off
    wake up the matrix, draw the centered dot

BOOT UP:
    start serial
    kill the LEDs right away so nothing flickers on
    set buttons to pull-up mode
    give it half a second to settle down
    turn on the matrix, dim it, clear it
    attach the servo
    call goToCenter()

MAIN LOOP (runs forever):
    check the light level

    IF it's bright enough:

        IF reset is pressed:
            goToCenter()
            brief pause

        ELSE IF right button is pressed:
            start sweeping, direction = -1
            only allowed between 0° and 90°
            left LEDs on, right LEDs off
            draw the left arrow
            brief pause

        ELSE IF left button is pressed:
            start sweeping, direction = +1
            only allowed between 90° and 180°
            right LEDs on, left LEDs off
            draw the right arrow
            brief pause

        IF still sweeping:
            move the servo one step in its direction
            IF it reaches the bottom of its range:
                lock it there, flip direction to +1
            ELSE IF it reaches the top:
                lock it there, flip direction to -1
            send that position to the servo
            tiny pause to control how fast it sweeps

    ELSE (too dark):
        stop sweeping
        clear the matrix and put it to sleep
        turn off every LED
